  {
   "id": "matematicas-2005-reserva-1-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el punto \\(P(2,0,1)\\) y la recta \\(r\\equiv\\begin{cases}x+2y=6\\\\z=2\\end{cases}\\)",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Halla la ecuación del plano que contiene a \\(P\\) y a \\(r\\).",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula el punto simétrico de \\(P\\) respecto de la recta \\(r\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\): con \\(y=t\\), \\(x=6-2t\\), \\(z=2\\): \\(r\\equiv(6-2t,\\,t,\\,2)\\), con \\(R(6,0,2)\\) y \\(\\vec d=(-2,1,0)\\).</p><p>El plano contiene a \\(\\vec d\\) y a \\(\\overrightarrow{RP}=(-4,0,-1)\\):</p>\\[\\vec n=\\vec d\\times\\overrightarrow{RP}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\-2&1&0\\\\-4&0&-1\\end{vmatrix}=(-1,\\,-2,\\,4)\\parallel(1,2,-4)\\]<p>Es de la forma \\(x+2y-4z+D=0\\) y contiene a \\(R\\): \\(6+0-8+D=0\\iff D=2\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(x+2y-4z+2=0\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación con \\(P\\): \\(2+0-4+2=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Uso \\(r\\equiv(6-2t,\\,t,\\,2)\\) del apartado a).</p><p><b>Paso 1. Plano perpendicular a la recta por el punto.</b> Como el plano \\(\\pi_\\perp\\) y la recta \\(r\\) son perpendiculares, el vector director de la recta es paralelo al vector normal del plano<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si el plano es perpendicular a la recta, el vector director de la recta es paralelo al normal del plano; por eso los coeficientes de \\(x\\), \\(y\\), \\(z\\) son las componentes de \\(\\vec d\\).</i>. Con \\(\\vec d=(-2,\\ 1,\\ 0)\\), el plano es de la forma</p>\\[\\pi_\\perp\\equiv -2x+y+D=0\\]<p>Como contiene al punto \\(P(2,\\ 0,\\ 1)\\): \\(-2\\cdot2+0+D=0\\iff D=4\\).</p>\\[\\pi_\\perp\\equiv -2x+y+4=0\\]<p><b>Paso 2. Punto de corte.</b> Sustituyo las paramétricas de \\(r\\) en \\(\\pi_\\perp\\):</p>\\[-2(6-2t)+(t)+4=0\\iff 5t-8=0\\iff t=\\frac{8}{5}\\]\\[M\\left(\\frac{14}{5},\\ \\frac{8}{5},\\ 2\\right)\\]<p><b>Paso 3. Punto medio.</b> \\(M\\) es el punto medio entre \\(P\\) y su simétrico \\(P'(a,b,c)\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>El simétrico \\(P'\\) cumple que \\(M\\) es el punto medio del segmento \\(PP'\\): cada coordenada de \\(M\\) es la media de las de \\(P\\) y \\(P'\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\frac{2+a}2=\\frac{14}{5},\\qquad\\frac{b}2=\\frac{8}{5},\\qquad\\frac{1+c}2=2\\]\\[a=\\frac{18}{5},\\qquad b=\\frac{16}{5},\\qquad c=3\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":36,\"el\":15,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[1.553,-0.894,4.0],[4.047,4.094,4.0],[4.047,4.094,0.0],[1.553,-0.894,0.0]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[4.047,4.094,0.0],\"π⊥\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[2.532,1.734,2.0],[2.415,1.5,1.854],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[2.415,1.5,1.854],[2.683,1.366,1.854],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[4.804,0.598,2.0],[0.796,2.602,2.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[0.796,2.602,2.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[2.263,1.868,2.0],[1.279,2.36,2.0],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[3.034,2.068,2.293],[2.05,2.56,2.293],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",6,10],[\"line\",[2.0,0.0,1.0],[3.6,3.2,3.0],\"#64748b\",1.3,true],[\"pt\",[2.0,0.0,1.0],\"P\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[2.8,1.6,2.0],\"M\",8,12],[\"pt\",[3.6,3.2,3.0],\"P′\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 409 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m05r1a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m05r1a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m05r1a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m05r1a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='57.2,18.0 171.0,74.8 171.0,246.0 57.2,189.2' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='175.0' y='246.0' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π⊥</text><line x1='125.9' y1='130.4' x2='120.6' y2='134.0' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='120.6' y1='134.0' x2='108.8' y2='135.6' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='26.0' y1='143.8' x2='202.2' y2='120.2' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='208.2' y='120.2' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='137.7' y1='128.8' x2='181.0' y2='123.0' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m05r1a4d)'/><text x='185.0' y='119.0' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d</text><line x1='124.8' y1='124.8' x2='168.1' y2='119.0' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m05r1a4n)'/><text x='174.1' y='129.0' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='700'>n</text><line x1='77.6' y1='156.6' x2='150.6' y2='107.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.3' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><circle cx='77.6' cy='156.6' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='84.6' y='150.6' font-weight='700'>P</text><circle cx='114.1' cy='132.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='122.1' y='144.0' font-weight='700'>M</text><circle cx='150.6' cy='107.4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='157.6' y='101.4' font-weight='700'>P′</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='14.6' y2='273.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='8.3' y='278.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='36.9' y2='272.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='38.5' y='277.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='254.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='253.1' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector normal</text></g><g transform='translate(249.9,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(353.4,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>El simétrico de \\(P\\) respecto de \\(r\\) es \\(P'\\left(\\frac{18}{5},\\ \\frac{16}{5},\\ 3\\right)\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(\\overrightarrow{PM}=\\left(\\frac{4}{5},\\ \\frac{8}{5},\\ 1\\right)\\) es perpendicular a \\(\\vec d\\): \\(-2\\cdot\\frac{4}{5}+\\frac{8}{5}+0\\cdot1=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
