  {
   "id": "matematicas-2005-reserva-1-5",
   "n": 5,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f\\) la función definida para \\(x\\neq0\\) por \\(f(x)=\\dfrac{x^2+1}x\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Estudia y determina las asíntotas de la gráfica de \\(f\\).",
     "(1 p.) Determina los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento de \\(f\\) y calcula sus extremos relativos o locales (puntos en los que se obtienen y valores que alcanza la función).",
     "(0,5 p.) Esboza la gráfica de \\(f\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p><b>Vertical:</b> \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{x^2+1}x=\\frac10=\\infty\\): \\(x=0\\).</p><p><b>Horizontal:</b> \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}\\frac{x^2+1}x=\\pm\\infty\\): no hay.</p><p><b>Oblicua:</b> \\(f(x)=x+\\frac1x\\), así que \\(m=\\displaystyle\\lim\\frac{f(x)}x=1\\) y \\(n=\\displaystyle\\lim(f(x)-x)=\\lim\\frac1x=0\\): \\(y=x\\).</p><div class='res'>Asíntota vertical \\(x=0\\) y asíntota oblicua \\(y=x\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(x=0\\) es un punto «problemático»<i class='n' data-t='why'>Los puntos «problemáticos» son los que no pertenecen al dominio (por ejemplo, los que anulan un denominador) y los puntos donde cambia la expresión de una función a trozos. Hay que marcarlos en la recta porque en ellos también puede cambiar el signo de la derivada.</i>. Signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>:</p>\\[f'(x)=1-\\frac1{x^2}=\\frac{x^2-1}{x^2}=0\\iff\\boxed{x=-1},\\ \\boxed{x=1}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 356 108' width='100%' style='max-width:427px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H342' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>−1</text><path d='M178 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='178' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><circle cx='178' cy='52' r='4.5' fill='var(--card,#fff)' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M260 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='260' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M43.0 40L79.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M70.0 11L79.0 10L77.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−2) &gt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M125.0 10L161.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M152.0 39L161.0 40L159.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−½) &lt; 0</text><text x='193.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M207.0 10L243.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M234.0 39L243.0 40L241.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='219.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(½) &lt; 0</text><text x='275.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M289.0 40L325.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M316.0 11L325.0 10L323.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='301.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(2) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(f\\) crece en \\((-\\infty,-1)\\) y \\((1,+\\infty)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\gt0\\), y decrece en \\((-1,0)\\) y \\((0,1)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\lt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>. Máximo en \\(x=-1\\), \\(f(-1)=-2\\); mínimo en \\(x=1\\), \\(f(1)=2\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>.</p><div class='res'>Crece en \\((-\\infty,-1)\\cup(1,+\\infty)\\); decrece en \\((-1,0)\\cup(0,1)\\). Máximo relativo \\((-1,-2)\\); mínimo relativo \\((1,2)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 240' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='20.0,194.3 21.6,193.5 23.1,192.6 24.7,191.8 26.3,191.0 27.9,190.1 29.4,189.3 31.0,188.5 32.6,187.7 34.2,186.9 35.7,186.0 37.3,185.2 38.9,184.4 40.4,183.6 42.0,182.8 43.6,182.0 45.2,181.1 46.7,180.3 48.3,179.5 49.9,178.7 51.5,177.9 53.0,177.1 54.6,176.3 56.2,175.5 57.8,174.7 59.3,173.9 60.9,173.1 62.5,172.3 64.0,171.5 65.6,170.8 67.2,170.0 68.8,169.2 70.3,168.4 71.9,167.7 73.5,166.9 75.1,166.1 76.6,165.4 78.2,164.6 79.8,163.9 81.3,163.1 82.9,162.4 84.5,161.7 86.1,160.9 87.6,160.2 89.2,159.5 90.8,158.8 92.4,158.1 93.9,157.4 95.5,156.8 97.1,156.1 98.6,155.4 100.2,154.8 101.8,154.2 103.4,153.6 104.9,153.0 106.5,152.4 108.1,151.9 109.7,151.4 111.2,150.9 112.8,150.4 114.4,150.0 116.0,149.6 117.5,149.3 119.1,149.0 120.7,148.8 122.2,148.6 123.8,148.6 125.4,148.6 127.0,148.8 128.5,149.1 130.1,149.6 131.7,150.3 133.3,151.4 134.8,152.8 136.4,154.8 138.0,157.5 139.5,161.3 141.1,166.7 142.7,174.9 144.3,187.9 145.8,211.6' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='154.2,28.4 155.7,52.1 157.3,65.1 158.9,73.3 160.5,78.7 162.0,82.5 163.6,85.2 165.2,87.2 166.7,88.6 168.3,89.7 169.9,90.4 171.5,90.9 173.0,91.2 174.6,91.4 176.2,91.4 177.8,91.4 179.3,91.2 180.9,91.0 182.5,90.7 184.0,90.4 185.6,90.0 187.2,89.6 188.8,89.1 190.3,88.6 191.9,88.1 193.5,87.6 195.1,87.0 196.6,86.4 198.2,85.8 199.8,85.2 201.3,84.6 202.9,83.9 204.5,83.2 206.1,82.6 207.6,81.9 209.2,81.2 210.8,80.5 212.4,79.8 213.9,79.1 215.5,78.3 217.1,77.6 218.7,76.9 220.2,76.1 221.8,75.4 223.4,74.6 224.9,73.9 226.5,73.1 228.1,72.3 229.7,71.6 231.2,70.8 232.8,70.0 234.4,69.2 236.0,68.5 237.5,67.7 239.1,66.9 240.7,66.1 242.2,65.3 243.8,64.5 245.4,63.7 247.0,62.9 248.5,62.1 250.1,61.3 251.7,60.5 253.3,59.7 254.8,58.9 256.4,58.0 258.0,57.2 259.6,56.4 261.1,55.6 262.7,54.8 264.3,54.0 265.8,53.1 267.4,52.3 269.0,51.5 270.6,50.7 272.1,49.9 273.7,49.0 275.3,48.2 276.9,47.4 278.4,46.5 280.0,45.7' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,191.4 150.0,120.0 280.0,48.6' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='124.0' cy='148.6' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='74.0' y='144.6'>(−1,−2)</text><circle cx='176.0' cy='91.4' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='182.0' y='103.4'>(1,2)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 120.0H294.0M150.0 234.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='46.0' y1='117.0' x2='46.0' y2='123.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='43.0' y='134.0' font-size='10'>-4</text><line x1='98.0' y1='117.0' x2='98.0' y2='123.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='95.0' y='134.0' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='202.0' y1='117.0' x2='202.0' y2='123.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='199.0' y='134.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='254.0' y1='117.0' x2='254.0' y2='123.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='251.0' y='134.0' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='147.0' y1='177.1' x2='153.0' y2='177.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='181.1' font-size='10'>-4</text><line x1='147.0' y1='62.9' x2='153.0' y2='62.9' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='66.9' font-size='10'>4</text></svg></div></div>"
