   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sean los vectores \\(\\vec v_1=(0,1,0)\\), \\(\\vec v_2=(2,1,-1)\\) y \\(\\vec v_3=(2,3,-1)\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,75 p.) ¿Son los vectores \\(\\vec v_1\\), \\(\\vec v_2\\) y \\(\\vec v_3\\) linealmente dependientes?",
     "(0,75 p.) ¿Para qué valores de \\(a\\) el vector \\((4,a+3,-2)\\) puede expresarse como combinación lineal de los vectores \\(\\vec v_1\\), \\(\\vec v_2\\) y \\(\\vec v_3\\)?",
     "(1 p.) Calcula un vector unitario y perpendicular a \\(\\vec v_1\\) y \\(\\vec v_2\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}0&1&0\\\\2&1&-1\\\\2&3&-1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0-2+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+0-2\\bigr)\\]\\[=0\\]<div class='res'>Sí, son linealmente dependientes (de hecho \\(\\vec v_3=2\\vec v_1+\\vec v_2\\))</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Como \\(\\vec v_3=2\\vec v_1+\\vec v_2\\), las combinaciones de los tres son las de \\(\\vec v_1\\) y \\(\\vec v_2\\). Busco \\(\\alpha\\vec v_1+\\beta\\vec v_2=(4,a+3,-2)\\):</p>\\[(2\\beta,\\ \\alpha+\\beta,\\ -\\beta)=(4,\\ a+3,\\ -2)\\iff\\beta=2,\\ \\alpha=a+1\\]<p>La 1.ª y la 3.ª componentes dan el mismo \\(\\beta=2\\), y \\(\\alpha\\) existe para cualquier \\(a\\).</p><div class='res'>Para todo \\(a\\in\\mathbb R\\): \\((4,a+3,-2)=(a+1)\\vec v_1+2\\vec v_2\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[\\vec v_1\\times\\vec v_2=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\0&1&0\\\\2&1&-1\\end{vmatrix}=(-1,\\,0,\\,-2),\\qquad|(-1,0,-2)|=\\sqrt5\\]<div class='res'>\\(\\left(-\\dfrac{\\sqrt5}5,0,-\\dfrac{2\\sqrt5}5\\right)\\) (o su opuesto)</div></div>"
    }
